        <mxCell id="step-1-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Deploy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;- agentcore deploy builds each agent (wrapped with BedrockAgentCoreApp) into a container image in Amazon ECR, which AgentCore Runtime runs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-1-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="step-2-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="580" x="0" y="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="2" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Authenticate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;- The match launcher (script or app) obtains a JWT from Amazon Cognito.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="step-3-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="580" x="0" y="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="3" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Launch players&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;- One InvokeAgentRuntime call per player with {match, name, model}. Each session runs in its own microVM; the match loop runs as an async task (up to 8 h).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="step-4-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="580" x="0" y="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="4" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inbound auth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;- AgentCore Identity validates the JWT against the Cognito issuer before the agent runs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="step-5-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="580" x="0" y="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="5" vertex="1" parent="step-5-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Play the match&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;- Agents connect their MCPClient directly to the production game MCP server over HTTPS (replaces localhost:8080) and call join_match, wait_for_turn and the action tools. No auth in v1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-5-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="step-6-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="580" x="0" y="500" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="6" vertex="1" parent="step-6-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ask the Strands Decider&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;- Reviewer and decider-loop agents call the 2B decider on a SageMaker real-time GPU endpoint via InvokeEndpoint, signed with the Runtime IAM role. Fail-open if it is unreachable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-6-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="step-7-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="580" x="0" y="600" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="7" vertex="1" parent="step-7-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;LLM reasoning&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;- Model calls to Amazon Bedrock (Haiku, Opus, Nova Lite). The decider-loop agent only calls the LLM when decider confidence is low.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-7-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="528" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="legend-aux-note" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontStyle=2;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Auxiliary: AgentCore Observability sends traces and logs to Amazon CloudWatch. The IAM execution role scopes access to Bedrock, ECR and SageMaker. Out of scope for v1: AgentCore Gateway and Memory.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="580" x="0" y="710" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
